OL,3,ASisters tell of upskirting 'violation'
OL,4,Aduring night out
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo sisters have described the
OL,7,F"complete violation" of being upskirted
OL,8,Fduring a night out in Manchester but
OL,9,Fsaid the men responsible had "chosen
OL,10,Fthe wrong girls" to target.
OL,12,FGeorgia, 25 and Alex Scholes, 22, had
OL,13,Fjust left a restaurant in the city's
OL,14,FSpinningfields area when two men
OL,15,Ffollowed them very closely up some
OL,16,Fstairs while filming them.
OL,18,FActress Georgia, who stars in ITV crime
OL,19,Fdrama The Bay, said "something felt
OL,20,Foff" when she noticed one of the men
OL,21,Fholding his phone awkwardly, before
OL,22,Frealising he was recording.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
